This package distributes misantronic/RAOfflineProxy (GPL-3.0-only) together
with the Leaf patch series under patches/ and the Leaf-owned modules under
src/. Those patches and modules modify and link against the upstream GPL-3.0
work, so this repository is GPL-3.0-only as a whole, rather than MIT like the
other UMRK paks.

Third-party components carry their own terms and are reproduced verbatim in
the built package under licenses/:

  RAOfflineProxy          GPL-3.0-only   upstream, misantronic
  CPython runtime         PSF-2.0
  liblzma / xz            0BSD
  CA certificate bundle   MPL-2.0        Mozilla, via curl
  Catastrophe             MIT            used by the pak's foreground UI

Catastrophe-LICENSE.txt is a verbatim copy of Catastrophe's own MIT license
and keeps that project's copyright line unchanged. It is a third-party license
reproduction, not this repository's attribution.
